  "details": "\"Nividia 3070\" Use to be when i would enter in, I would get 65% - 75% usage on normal standard worlds and 75% being in tougher worlds with lighting and detail but sense the final update release for personal mirrors. Now my GPU spikes to and holds 80% usage this is GPU usage not VRAM that's still normal around 65% - 75%. And that is just no mirror yet popped open. When open with environment showing GPU usage spike's and holds to 85% - 90% and at this point i start to get crappy fps. I haven't changed any setting no nothing cause everything was fine but after update I've had to reduce my resolution, and bitrate just to keep it under but now hard for me to see thing's now. And any decent texture world's i go to i lose fps.",
